        "content": [
          {
            "Text": "[Wed 2026-04-22 02:54 UTC] Task: Fix web text chat system\n\nUser reports web text chat is not working again.\n\nINVESTIGATE:\n1. Check if Next.js frontend is running on port 3000\n2. Check WebSocket connections for chat (ws://localhost:4444/ws/events or similar)\n3. Check OpenClaw gateway (:18789) is responding to chat requests\n4. Check if bot gateway (:4444) is proxying messages correctly\n5. Look for errors in:\n   - Browser console (WebSocket failures)\n   - Gateway logs\n   - Bot gateway logs\n\nCOMMON ISSUES:\n- WebSocket URL mismatch (wss vs ws, wrong port)\n- CORS errors between frontend and backend\n- Gateway not forwarding to Discord/web channels\n- Session/auth token expired\n\nFIXES TO TRY:\n1. Verify all services running (pm2 status or similar)\n2. Check env vars match (NEXT_PUBLIC_BOT_CONTROL_BASE_URL, etc.)\n3. Test WebSocket connection manually\n4. Check if channels.discord.enabled is still true in openclaw.json\n\nReturn: What's broken, where, and how to fix it."
          }
        ]
      }
    },
